+
+```text
+lst1 = ["🙂"]       Python total = 1
+lst2 = ["ab"]      Python total = 2
+
+trusted canonical result: ["🙂"]
+candidate Python result:  ["🙂"]
+fresh LLVM K result:       ["ab"]
+fresh Haskell K result:    ["ab"]
+```
+
+Both `krun` commands exited 0.  Exact commands and output are in
